window.Handbook.register({"id":"ch070","pages":[{"n":503,"html":"<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b502\"></span><h2 class=\"book-heading\">第70 章设备树展开流程</h2>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">设备树会被编译成DTB 文件并不会被编译进内核。但是因为设备树描述的是硬件资源，内核又要使用设备树中描述的硬件资源。所以Linux 会把设备树转换成内核可以识别的格式。如图70.1 是设备树的转换流程。</p>\n<figure class=\"book-figure\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"zoom-image\" aria-label=\"放大图70.1\"><img src=\"3568阅读资源/figures/p0503-fig01.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"图70.1\" width=\"979\" height=\"229\"></button><figcaption>图70.1 · 点击放大</figcaption></figure>\n<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b503\"></span><h3 class=\"book-heading\">70.1 dtb 展开成device_node</h3>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">在图63.1 中提到内核在初始化的时候会将加载到内存里面的dtb 文件展开成内核可以识别的设备树，这里的可识别格式就是指将dtb 解析成内核中的设备节点，在Linux 中用device_node结构体表示设备节点。device_node 结构体定义在内核源码的include/linux/of.h 文件中，具体内容如代码清单70.1 所示。</p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单70.1</p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"13\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1</span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct device_node {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2</span><span class=\"source-line\">    const char *name;        //设备节点的名称</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3</span><span class=\"source-line\">    const char *type;        //设备节点的类型</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4</span><span class=\"source-line\">    phandle phandle;        //设备节点的句柄</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5</span><span class=\"source-line\">    const char *full_name;        //设备节点的完整名称</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6</span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct fwnode_handle fwnode;   //设备节点的固件节点句柄</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8</span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct property *properties;     //设备节点的属性列表</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">9</span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct property *deadprops;    //已删除的属性列表</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">10</span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct device_node *parent;    //设备节点的父节点</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">11</span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct device_node *child;     //设备节点的子节点</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">12</span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct device_node *sibling;   //设备节点的同级节点</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">13</span><span class=\"source-line\">    #if defined(CONFIG_OF_KOBJ)</span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 503 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"503\">核对原页</button></p></div>"},{"n":504,"html":"<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"14\" data-end=\"23\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单 · 跨页续接</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">14</span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct kobject kobj;        //内核对象（用于sysfs）</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">15</span><span class=\"source-line\">    #endif</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">16</span><span class=\"source-line\">    unsigned long _flags;        //设备节点的标志位</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">17</span><span class=\"source-line\">    void *data;        //与设备节点相关的数据指针</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">18</span><span class=\"source-line\">    #if defined(CONFIG_SPARC)</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">19</span><span class=\"source-line\">    const char *path_component_name; //设备节点的路径组件名称</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">20</span><span class=\"source-line\">    unsigned int unique_id;        //设备节点的唯一标识</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">21</span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct of_irq_controller *irq_trans; //设备节点的中断控制器</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">22</span><span class=\"source-line\">    #endif</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">23</span><span class=\"source-line\">};</span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 504 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"504\">核对原页</button></p></div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">可以通过device_node 结构体中节点的名字、父节点、子节点和同级节点，以代码方式构建出与dts 文件中一致的设备节点关系。</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">其中properties 字段是指向设备节点属性的指针。设备节点的属性包含了与设备节点相关联的配置和参数信息。property 字段同样定义在内核源码的include/linux/of.h 文件中，具体内容如代码清单70.2 所示。</p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单70.2</p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"15\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1</span><span class=\"source-line\">struct property {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2</span><span class=\"source-line\">    char *name;        //属性的名称</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3</span><span class=\"source-line\">    int length;        //属性值的长度（字节数）</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4</span><span class=\"source-line\">    void *value;        //属性值</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5</span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct property *next;        //指向节点的下一个属性</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6</span><span class=\"source-line\">    #if defined(CONFIG_OF_DYNAMIC) || defined(CONFIG_SPARC)</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7</span><span class=\"source-line\">    unsigned long _flags;        //属性的标志位</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8</span><span class=\"source-line\">    #endif</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">9</span><span class=\"source-line\">    #if defined(CONFIG_OF_PROMTREE)</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">10</span><span class=\"source-line\">    unsigned int unique_id;        //属性的唯一标识</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">11</span><span class=\"source-line\">    #endif</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">12</span><span class=\"source-line\">    #if defined(CONFIG_OF_KOBJ)</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">13</span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct bin_attribute attr;     //内核对象二进制属性</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">14</span><span class=\"source-line\">    #endif</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">15</span><span class=\"source-line\">};</span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 504 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"504\">核对原页</button></p></div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">例如代码清单70.3 展示了在根节点下有led 和beep 两个子节点，每个子节点都有一个compatible 属性。同时根节点还定义了#address-cells 和#size-cells 属性。</p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单70.3</p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"4\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1</span><span class=\"source-line\">/ {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2</span><span class=\"source-line\">    #address-cells = &lt;1&gt;;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3</span><span class=\"source-line\">    #size-cells = &lt;1&gt;;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4</span><span class=\"source-line\">    led{</span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 504 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"504\">核对原页</button></p></div>"},{"n":505,"html":"<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"5\" data-end=\"10\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单 · 跨页续接</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5</span><span class=\"source-line\">        compatible = &quot;led&quot;;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6</span><span class=\"source-line\">    };</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7</span><span class=\"source-line\">    beep{</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8</span><span class=\"source-line\">        compatible = &quot;beep&quot;;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">9</span><span class=\"source-line\">    };</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">10</span><span class=\"source-line\">};</span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 505 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"505\">核对原页</button></p></div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">代码清单70.3 中的节点在代码中用device_node 结构体表示，其扁平化结构如图70.2 所示。</p>\n<figure class=\"book-figure\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"zoom-image\" aria-label=\"放大图70.2\"><img src=\"3568阅读资源/figures/p0505-fig01.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"图70.2\" width=\"975\" height=\"662\"></button><figcaption>图70.2 · 点击放大</figcaption></figure>\n<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b504\"></span><h3 class=\"book-heading\">70.2 dtb 展开过程源码分析</h3>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">dtb 文件最终会展开成device_node 这一可以让内核识别的格式，那更具体的实现流程是怎样的呢，我们继续解析源码。</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">首先来到内核源码目录下的init/main.c 文件，找到其中的start_kernel ()函数，该函数是Linux 内核启动的入口点，它是Linux 内核的核心函数之一，负责完成内核的初始化和启动过程，具体内容如代码清单70.4 所示。</p>"},{"n":506,"html":"<p class=\"caption\">代码清单70.4</p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"31\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1</span><span class=\"source-line\">asmlinkage __visible void __init start_kernel(void)</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2</span><span class=\"source-line\">{</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3</span><span class=\"source-line\">    char *command_line;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4</span><span class=\"source-line\">    char *after_dashes;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6</span><span class=\"source-line\">    set_task_stack_end_magic(&amp;init_task);    //设置任务栈的魔数</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7</span><span class=\"source-line\">    smp_setup_processor_id();    //设置处理器ID</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8</span><span class=\"source-line\">    debug_objects_early_init();    //初始化调试对象</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">9</span><span class=\"source-line\">    cgroup_init_early();    //初始化cgroup（控制组）</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">10</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">11</span><span class=\"source-line\">    local_irq_disable();    //禁用本地中断</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">12</span><span class=\"source-line\">    early_boot_irqs_disabled = true;     //标记早期引导期间中断已禁用</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">13</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">14</span><span class=\"source-line\">    /*</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">15</span><span class=\"source-line\">     * 中断仍然被禁用。进行必要的设置，然后启用它们。</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">16</span><span class=\"source-line\">     */</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">17</span><span class=\"source-line\">    boot_cpu_init();    //初始化引导CPU</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">18</span><span class=\"source-line\">    page_address_init();    //设置页地址</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">19</span><span class=\"source-line\">    pr_notice(&quot;%s&quot;, linux_banner);    //打印Linux 内核版本信息</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">20</span><span class=\"source-line\">    setup_arch(&amp;command_line);    //架构相关的初始化</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">21</span><span class=\"source-line\">    mm_init_cpumask(&amp;init_mm);    //初始化内存管理的cpumask（CPU 掩码）</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">22</span><span class=\"source-line\">    setup_command_line(command_line);    //设置命令行参数</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">23</span><span class=\"source-line\">    setup_nr_cpu_ids();    //设置CPU 个数</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">24</span><span class=\"source-line\">    setup_per_cpu_areas();    //设置每个CPU 的区域</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">25</span><span class=\"source-line\">    smp_prepare_boot_cpu();    //准备启动CPU（架构特定的启动CPU 钩子）</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">26</span><span class=\"source-line\">    boot_cpu_hotplug_init();    //初始化热插拔的引导CPU</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">27</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">28</span><span class=\"source-line\">    build_all_zonelists(NULL);    //构建所有内存区域列表</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">29</span><span class=\"source-line\">    page_alloc_init();    //初始化页面分配器</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">30</span><span class=\"source-line\">    ........</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">31</span><span class=\"source-line\">}</span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 506 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"506\">核对原页</button></p></div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">代码清单70.3 中跟设备树相关的函数为第20 行的setup_arch(&amp;command_line)，该函数定义在内核源码的arch/arm64/kernel/setup.c 文件中，具体内容如代码清单70.5 所示。</p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单70.5</p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"5\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1</span><span class=\"source-line\">void __init setup_arch(char **cmdline_p)</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2</span><span class=\"source-line\">{</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3</span><span class=\"source-line\">    init_mm.start_code = (unsigned long) _text;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4</span><span class=\"source-line\">    init_mm.end_code   = (unsigned long) _etext;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5</span><span class=\"source-line\">    init_mm.end_data   = (unsigned long) _edata;</span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 506 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"506\">核对原页</button></p></div>"},{"n":507,"html":"<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"6\" data-end=\"41\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单 · 跨页续接</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6</span><span class=\"source-line\">    init_mm.brk      = (unsigned long) _end;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8</span><span class=\"source-line\">    *cmdline_p = boot_command_line; //记录了uboot 传递给内核的command_line，大小为4096。</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">9</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">10</span><span class=\"source-line\">    early_fixmap_init();    //初始化early fixmap</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">11</span><span class=\"source-line\">    early_ioremap_init();    //初始化early ioremap</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">12</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">13</span><span class=\"source-line\">    setup_machine_fdt(__fdt_pointer);    //设置机器的FDT（平台设备树）</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">14</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">15</span><span class=\"source-line\">    //初始化静态密钥，早期可能会被cpufeature 代码和早期参数启用</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">16</span><span class=\"source-line\">    jump_label_init();</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">17</span><span class=\"source-line\">    parse_early_param();</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">18</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">19</span><span class=\"source-line\">    //在启动可能的早期控制台后，解除屏蔽异步中断和FIQ（一旦我们可以报告发生的系统错误）</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">20</span><span class=\"source-line\">    local_daif_restore(DAIF_PROCCTX_NOIRQ);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">21</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">22</span><span class=\"source-line\">    //在这个阶段，TTBR0 仅用于身份映射。将其指向零页面，以避免做出猜测性的新条目获取。</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">23</span><span class=\"source-line\">    cpu_uninstall_idmap();</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">24</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">25</span><span class=\"source-line\">    xen_early_init();    // Xen 平台的早期初始化</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">26</span><span class=\"source-line\">    efi_init();    // EFI 平台的初始化</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">27</span><span class=\"source-line\">    arm64_memblock_init();    // ARM64 内存块的初始化</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">28</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">29</span><span class=\"source-line\">    paging_init();    //分页初始化</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">30</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">31</span><span class=\"source-line\">    acpi_table_upgrade();    // ACPI 表的升级</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">32</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">33</span><span class=\"source-line\">    //解析ACPI 表以进行可能的引导时配置</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">34</span><span class=\"source-line\">    acpi_boot_table_init();</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">35</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">36</span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (acpi_disabled)</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">37</span><span class=\"source-line\">        unflatten_device_tree();    //展开设备树</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">38</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">39</span><span class=\"source-line\">    bootmem_init();    //引导内存的初始化</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">40</span><span class=\"source-line\">    ............</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">41</span><span class=\"source-line\">}</span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 507 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"507\">核对原页</button></p></div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">在setup_arch()函数中与设备树相关的函数分别为第13 行的setup_machine_fdt(__fdt_point er)和第37 行的unflatten_device_tree()，接下来将对上述两个函数进行详细的介绍。</p>\n<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b505\"></span><h4 class=\"book-heading\">70.2.1 setup_machine_fdt(__fdt_pointer)函数</h4>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">setup_machine_fdt(__fdt_pointer)中的__fdt_pointer 参数是uboot 传递给内核的dtb 文件加载到内存的地址。以ARM64 为例，在内核源码目录下的arch/arm64/kernel/head.S 文件中把d tb 加载地址保存到了__fdt_pointer 中，关键内容如代码清单70.6 所示。</p>"},{"n":508,"html":"<p class=\"caption\">代码清单70.6</p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"5\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1</span><span class=\"source-line\">preserve_boot_args:</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2</span><span class=\"source-line\">    mov x21, x0        // x21=FDT</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4</span><span class=\"source-line\">__primary_switched:</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5</span><span class=\"source-line\">    str_l x21, __fdt_pointer, x5        // Save FDT pointer</span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 508 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"508\">核对原页</button></p></div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">x0 寄存器值由uboot 设置，保存的是dtb 在内存中的物理地址。代码清单63.5 中第2 行将寄存器x0 的值复制到寄存器x21 中，第5 行又将寄存器x21 的值存储到__fdt_pointer 中。这样uboot 就把dtb 地址传递给了内核。。</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">然后来看setup_machine_fdt()函数，该函数定义在内核源码的arch/arm64/kernel/setup.c文件中，具体内容如代码清单70.7 所示。</p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单70.7</p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"26\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1</span><span class=\"source-line\">//初始化设置机器的设备树</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2</span><span class=\"source-line\">static void __init setup_machine_fdt(phys_addr_t dt_phys)</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3</span><span class=\"source-line\">{</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4</span><span class=\"source-line\">    int size;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5</span><span class=\"source-line\">    //将设备树物理地址映射到内核虚拟地址空间</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6</span><span class=\"source-line\">    void *dt_virt = fixmap_remap_fdt(dt_phys, &amp;size, PAGE_KERNEL);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7</span><span class=\"source-line\">    const char *name;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">9</span><span class=\"source-line\">    //如果映射成功</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">10</span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (dt_virt) {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">11</span><span class=\"source-line\">        //保留设备树占用的内存区域</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">12</span><span class=\"source-line\">        memblock_reserve(dt_phys, size);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">13</span><span class=\"source-line\">    }</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">14</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">15</span><span class=\"source-line\">    // 如果设备树映射失败或者设备树解析失败</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">16</span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (!dt_virt || !early_init_dt_scan(dt_virt)) {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">17</span><span class=\"source-line\">        //输出错误信息</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">18</span><span class=\"source-line\">        pr_crit(&quot;\\n&quot;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">19</span><span class=\"source-line\">        &quot;Error: invalid device tree blob at physical address %pa (virtual address 0x%p)\\n&quot;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">20</span><span class=\"source-line\">        &quot;The dtb must be 8-byte aligned and must not exceed 2 MB in size\\n&quot;//dtb 文件大小不能超过2M</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">21</span><span class=\"source-line\">        &quot;\\nPlease check your bootloader.&quot;,</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">22</span><span class=\"source-line\">        &amp;dt_phys, dt_virt);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">23</span><span class=\"source-line\">        //无限循环，等待系统崩溃</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">24</span><span class=\"source-line\">        while (true)</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">25</span><span class=\"source-line\">            cpu_relax();</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">26</span><span class=\"source-line\">    }</span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 508 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"508\">核对原页</button></p></div>"},{"n":509,"html":"<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"27\" data-end=\"38\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单 · 跨页续接</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">27</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">28</span><span class=\"source-line\">    //将设备树所在的内存地址设置为只读模式</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">29</span><span class=\"source-line\">    fixmap_remap_fdt(dt_phys, &amp;size, PAGE_KERNEL_RO);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">30</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">31</span><span class=\"source-line\">    //获取设备树根节点下的model 和compatible 的属性值</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">32</span><span class=\"source-line\">    name = of_flat_dt_get_machine_name();</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">33</span><span class=\"source-line\">    //如果设备树没有机器名，则返回</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">34</span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (!name)</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">35</span><span class=\"source-line\">        return;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">36</span><span class=\"source-line\">        pr_info(&quot;Machine model: %s\\n&quot;, name); //输出model 属性值</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">37</span><span class=\"source-line\">        dump_stack_set_arch_desc(&quot;%s (DT)&quot;, name); //设置堆栈描述信息</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">38</span><span class=\"source-line\">}</span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 509 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"509\">核对原页</button></p></div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">在代码清单70.7 第6 行中该函数将dtb 位于内存的物理地址映射成虚拟地址。然后使用memblock_reserve(dt_phys, size)将dtb 位于内存的物理地址保留，防止该地址被覆盖。然后通过调用early_init_dt_scan()进行扫描，检查设备树的有效性和完整性。检查完成后调用fixmap_remap_fdt()将设备树所在的内存地址设置为只读模式。early_init_dt_scan()函数定义在内核源码的drivers/of/fdt.c 目录下，具体内容如代码清单70.8 所示。</p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单70.8</p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"13\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1</span><span class=\"source-line\">bool __init early_init_dt_scan(void *params)</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2</span><span class=\"source-line\">{</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3</span><span class=\"source-line\">    bool status;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5</span><span class=\"source-line\">    // 验证设备树的兼容性和完整性</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6</span><span class=\"source-line\">    status = early_init_dt_verify(params);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7</span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (!status)</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8</span><span class=\"source-line\">        return false;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">9</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">10</span><span class=\"source-line\">    // 扫描设备树节点</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">11</span><span class=\"source-line\">    early_init_dt_scan_nodes();</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">12</span><span class=\"source-line\">    return true;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">13</span><span class=\"source-line\">}</span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 509 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"509\">核对原页</button></p></div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">在代码清单70.8 第6 行中调用了early_init_dt_verify() 函数校验检查设备树，该函数的具体内容如代码清单70.9 所示。</p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单70.9</p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"4\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1</span><span class=\"source-line\">bool __init early_init_dt_verify(void *params)</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2</span><span class=\"source-line\">{</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3</span><span class=\"source-line\">    // 验证传入的参数是否为空</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4</span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (!params)</span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 509 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"509\">核对原页</button></p></div>"},{"n":510,"html":"<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"5\" data-end=\"21\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单 · 跨页续接</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5</span><span class=\"source-line\">        return false;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7</span><span class=\"source-line\">    // 检查设备树头部的有效性</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8</span><span class=\"source-line\">    // 如果设备树头部无效，返回false</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">9</span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (fdt_check_header(params))</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">10</span><span class=\"source-line\">        return false;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">11</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">12</span><span class=\"source-line\">    //将dtb 的虚拟地址保存到了initial_boot_params 中</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">13</span><span class=\"source-line\">    initial_boot_params = params;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">14</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">15</span><span class=\"source-line\">    //计算设备树的CRC32 校验值</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">16</span><span class=\"source-line\">    //并将结果保存在全局变量of_fdt_crc32 中</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">17</span><span class=\"source-line\">    of_fdt_crc32 = crc32_be(~0, initial_boot_params, fdt_totalsize(initial_boot_params));</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">18</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">19</span><span class=\"source-line\">    //返回true，表示设备树验证和初始化成功</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">20</span><span class=\"source-line\">    return true;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">21</span><span class=\"source-line\">}</span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 510 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"510\">核对原页</button></p></div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">early_init_dt_verify() 函数主要进行校验检查的工作。除此之外在代码清单63.9 第13 行该函数将dtb 的虚拟地址保存到了initial_boot_params 中。</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">然后继续回到early_init_dt_scan() 函数中，如果设备树验证成功（即status 为真），则调用early_init_dt_scan_nodes() 函数，这个函数的作用是扫描设备树的节点并进行相应的处理，该函数的具体内容如代码清单70.10 所示。</p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单70.10</p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"11\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1</span><span class=\"source-line\">void __init early_init_dt_scan_nodes(void)</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2</span><span class=\"source-line\">    {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3</span><span class=\"source-line\">    /* 从/chosen 节点中检索各种信息*/</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4</span><span class=\"source-line\">    of_scan_flat_dt(early_init_dt_scan_chosen, boot_command_line);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6</span><span class=\"source-line\">    /* 初始化{size,address}-cells 信息*/</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7</span><span class=\"source-line\">    of_scan_flat_dt(early_init_dt_scan_root, NULL);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">9</span><span class=\"source-line\">    /* 设置内存信息，调用early_init_dt_add_memory_arch 函数*/</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">10</span><span class=\"source-line\">    of_scan_flat_dt(early_init_dt_scan_memory, NULL);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">11</span><span class=\"source-line\">}</span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 510 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"510\">核对原页</button></p></div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">该函数会遍历设备树的节点，解析出重要的信息用于内核启动。</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">至此，关于setup_machine_fdt(__fdt_pointer)代码的分析就完成了。</p>\n<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b506\"></span><h4 class=\"book-heading\">70.2.2 unflatten_device_tree 函数</h4>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">unflatten_device_tree()函数为dtb 展开成device_node 树状结构的核心函数。该函数定义在</p>"},{"n":511,"html":"<p class=\"body-copy\">内核源码的drivers/of/fdt.c 文件中，具体内容如代码清单70.11 所示。</p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单70.11</p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"12\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1</span><span class=\"source-line\">void __init unflatten_device_tree(void)</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2</span><span class=\"source-line\">{</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3</span><span class=\"source-line\">    /* 解析设备树*/</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4</span><span class=\"source-line\">    __unflatten_device_tree(initial_boot_params, NULL, &amp;of_root,</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5</span><span class=\"source-line\">                           early_init_dt_alloc_memory_arch, false);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7</span><span class=\"source-line\">    /* 获取指向&quot;/chosen&quot; 和&quot;/aliases&quot; 节点的指针，以供全局使用*/</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8</span><span class=\"source-line\">    of_alias_scan(early_init_dt_alloc_memory_arch);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">9</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">10</span><span class=\"source-line\">    /* 运行设备树的单元测试*/</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">11</span><span class=\"source-line\">    unittest_unflatten_overlay_base();</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">12</span><span class=\"source-line\">}</span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 511 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"511\">核对原页</button></p></div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">代码清单70.11 第4 行封装了__unflatten_device_tree 函数，该函数中的initial_boot_param s 参数就是代码清单63.9 中保存的dtb 的虚拟地址，of_root 参数为设备树的device_node 的根节点的指针，early_init_dt_alloc_memory_arch 参数是为device_node 和property 这两个结构体分配地址。该函数的具体内容如代码清单70.12 所示。</p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单70.12</p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"19\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1</span><span class=\"source-line\">void *__unflatten_device_tree(const void *blob,</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2</span><span class=\"source-line\">              struct device_node *dad,</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3</span><span class=\"source-line\">                  struct device_node **mynodes,</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4</span><span class=\"source-line\">                  void *(*dt_alloc)(u64 size, u64 align),</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5</span><span class=\"source-line\">                  bool detached)</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6</span><span class=\"source-line\">{</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7</span><span class=\"source-line\">    int size;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8</span><span class=\"source-line\">    void *mem;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">9</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">10</span><span class=\"source-line\">    pr_debug(&quot; -&gt; unflatten_device_tree()\\n&quot;);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">11</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">12</span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (!blob) {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">13</span><span class=\"source-line\">        pr_debug(&quot;No device tree pointer\\n&quot;);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">14</span><span class=\"source-line\">        return NULL;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">15</span><span class=\"source-line\">    }</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">16</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">17</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">18</span><span class=\"source-line\">    pr_debug(&quot;Unflattening device tree:\\n&quot;);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">19</span><span class=\"source-line\">    pr_debug(&quot;magic: %08x\\n&quot;, fdt_magic(blob));</span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 511 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"511\">核对原页</button></p></div>"},{"n":512,"html":"<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"20\" data-end=\"60\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单 · 跨页续接</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">20</span><span class=\"source-line\">    pr_debug(&quot;size: %08x\\n&quot;, fdt_totalsize(blob));</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">21</span><span class=\"source-line\">    pr_debug(&quot;version: %08x\\n&quot;, fdt_version(blob));</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">22</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">23</span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (fdt_check_header(blob)) {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">24</span><span class=\"source-line\">        pr_err(&quot;Invalid device tree blob header\\n&quot;);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">25</span><span class=\"source-line\">        return NULL;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">26</span><span class=\"source-line\">    }</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">27</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">28</span><span class=\"source-line\">    /* 第一遍扫描，计算大小*/</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">29</span><span class=\"source-line\">    size = unflatten_dt_nodes(blob, NULL, dad, NULL);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">30</span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (size &lt; 0)</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">31</span><span class=\"source-line\">        return NULL;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">32</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">33</span><span class=\"source-line\">    size = ALIGN(size, 4);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">34</span><span class=\"source-line\">    pr_debug(&quot;  大小为%d，正在分配内存...\\n&quot;, size);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">35</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">36</span><span class=\"source-line\">    /* 为展开的设备树分配内存*/</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">37</span><span class=\"source-line\">    mem = dt_alloc(size + 4, alignof(struct device_node));</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">38</span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (!mem)</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">39</span><span class=\"source-line\">        return NULL;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">40</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">41</span><span class=\"source-line\">    memset(mem, 0, size);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">42</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">43</span><span class=\"source-line\">    *(__be32 *)(mem + size) = cpu_to_be32(0xdeadbeef);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">44</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">45</span><span class=\"source-line\">    pr_debug(&quot;  正在展开%p...\\n&quot;, mem);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">46</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">47</span><span class=\"source-line\">    /* 第二遍扫描，实际展开设备树*/</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">48</span><span class=\"source-line\">    unflatten_dt_nodes(blob, mem, dad, mynodes);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">49</span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (be32_to_cpup(mem + size) != 0xdeadbeef)</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">50</span><span class=\"source-line\">        pr_warning(&quot;End of tree marker overwritten: %08x\\n&quot;,</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">51</span><span class=\"source-line\">               be32_to_cpup(mem + size));</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">52</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">53</span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (detached &amp;&amp; mynodes) {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">54</span><span class=\"source-line\">        of_node_set_flag(*mynodes, OF_DETACHED);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">55</span><span class=\"source-line\">        pr_debug(&quot;unflattened tree is detached\\n&quot;);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">56</span><span class=\"source-line\">    }</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">57</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">58</span><span class=\"source-line\">    pr_debug(&quot; &lt;- unflatten_device_tree()\\n&quot;);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">59</span><span class=\"source-line\">    return mem;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">60</span><span class=\"source-line\">}</span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 512 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"512\">核对原页</button></p></div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">该函数的重点在两次设备树的扫描上。</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">第一遍扫描的目的是计算展开设备树所需的内存大小。代码清单70.12 第29 行中</p>"},{"n":513,"html":"<p class=\"body-copy\">unflatten_dt_nodes()函数的作用就是递归地遍历设备树数据块，并计算展开设备树所需的内存大小。它的第二个参数为NULL 表示只统计大小不做其他操作。计算完成后，unflatten_dt_nodes()函数会返回展开设备树所需的内存大小，然后在对大小进行对齐操作，并为展开的设备树分配</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">内存。</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">第二遍扫描的目的是实际展开设备树，并填充设备节点的名称、类型和属性等信息。代码清单70.12 第48 行中再次调用了unflatten_dt_nodes 函数进行第二遍扫描，第二个参数不再是NULL，第二遍扫描会将设备树数据块中的节点展开为真正的设备节点，并填充节点的名称、类型和属性等信息。这样就完成了设备树的展开过程。</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">其中unflatten_dt_nodes()函数具体定义如代码清单70.13 所示。</p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单70.13</p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"28\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1</span><span class=\"source-line\">static int unflatten_dt_nodes(const void *blob,</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2</span><span class=\"source-line\">                  void *mem,</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3</span><span class=\"source-line\">                  struct device_node *dad,</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4</span><span class=\"source-line\">                  struct device_node **nodepp)</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5</span><span class=\"source-line\">{</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6</span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct device_node *root;  // 根节点</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7</span><span class=\"source-line\">    int offset = 0, depth = 0, initial_depth = 0;  // 偏移量、深度和初始深度</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8</span><span class=\"source-line\">    #define FDT_MAX_DEPTH64  // 最大深度</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">9</span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct device_node *nps[FDT_MAX_DEPTH];  // 设备节点数组</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">10</span><span class=\"source-line\">    void *base = mem;  // 基地址，用于计算偏移量</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">11</span><span class=\"source-line\">    bool dryrun = !base;  // 是否只是模拟运行，不实际处理</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">12</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">13</span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (nodepp)</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">14</span><span class=\"source-line\">        *nodepp = NULL;  // 如果指针不为空，将其置为空指针</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">15</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">16</span><span class=\"source-line\">    /*</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">17</span><span class=\"source-line\">     * 如果@dad 有效，则表示正在展开设备子树。</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">18</span><span class=\"source-line\">     * 在第一层深度可能有多个节点。</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">19</span><span class=\"source-line\">     * 将@depth 设置为1，以使fdt_next_node() 正常工作。</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">20</span><span class=\"source-line\">     * 当发现负的@depth 时，该函数会立即退出。</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">21</span><span class=\"source-line\">     * 否则，除第一个节点外的设备节点将无法成功展开。</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">22</span><span class=\"source-line\">     */</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">23</span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (dad)</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">24</span><span class=\"source-line\">        depth = initial_depth = 1;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">25</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">26</span><span class=\"source-line\">    root = dad;  // 根节点为@dad</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">27</span><span class=\"source-line\">    nps[depth] = dad;  // 将根节点放入设备节点数组</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">28</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 513 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"513\">核对原页</button></p></div>"},{"n":514,"html":"<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"29\" data-end=\"61\" data-contiguous=\"true\" data-recovered=\"pdf-text\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">29</span><span class=\"source-line\">         for (offset = 0;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">30</span><span class=\"source-line\">                   offset &gt;= 0 &amp;&amp; depth &gt;= initial_depth;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">31</span><span class=\"source-line\">                   offset = fdt_next_node(blob, offset, &amp;depth)) {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">32</span><span class=\"source-line\">                  if (WARN_ON_ONCE(depth &gt;= FDT_MAX_DEPTH))</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">33</span><span class=\"source-line\">                          continue;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">34</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">35</span><span class=\"source-line\">                  // 如果未启用  CONFIG_OF_KOBJ 并且节点不可用，则跳过该节点</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">36</span><span class=\"source-line\">                  if (!IS_ENABLED(CONFIG_OF_KOBJ) &amp;&amp;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">37</span><span class=\"source-line\">                          !of_fdt_device_is_available(blob, offset))</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">38</span><span class=\"source-line\">                          continue;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">39</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">40</span><span class=\"source-line\">                  // 填充节点信息，并将子节点添加到设备节点数组</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">41</span><span class=\"source-line\">                  if (!populate_node(blob, offset, &amp;mem, nps[depth],</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">42</span><span class=\"source-line\">                                         &amp;nps[depth+1], dryrun))</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">43</span><span class=\"source-line\">                          return mem - base;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">44</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">45</span><span class=\"source-line\">                  if (!dryrun &amp;&amp; nodepp &amp;&amp; !*nodepp)</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">46</span><span class=\"source-line\">                          *nodepp = nps[depth+1];    // 将子节点指针赋值给  @nodepp</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">47</span><span class=\"source-line\">                  if (!dryrun &amp;&amp; !root)</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">48</span><span class=\"source-line\">                          root = nps[depth+1];    // 如果根节点为空，则将子节点设置为根节点</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">49</span><span class=\"source-line\">         }</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">50</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">58</span><span class=\"source-line\">         if (offset &lt; 0 &amp;&amp; offset != -FDT_ERR_NOTFOUND) {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">52</span><span class=\"source-line\">                  pr_err(\"Error %d processing FDT\\n\", offset);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">53</span><span class=\"source-line\">                  return -EINVAL;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">54</span><span class=\"source-line\">         }</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">55</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">56</span><span class=\"source-line\">         // 反转子节点列表。一些驱动程序假设节点顺序与  .dts 文件中的节点顺序一致</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">57</span><span class=\"source-line\">         if (!dryrun)</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">58</span><span class=\"source-line\">                  reverse_nodes(root);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">59</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">60</span><span class=\"source-line\">         return mem - base;    // 返回处理的字节数</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">61</span><span class=\"source-line\">}</span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">从原书文字层恢复 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"514\">核对原页</button></p></div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">在代码清单70.13 中29-49 行为一个for 循环，其中首先会调用fdt_next_node() 函数用来遍历获取设备树的每一个节点。找到节点后，调用populate_node() 函数填充节点信息，构造每一个device_node 以及其下对应的property。其中populate_node() 函数定义如代码清单70.14所示。</p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单70.14</p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"3\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1</span><span class=\"source-line\">static bool populate_node(const void *blob,</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2</span><span class=\"source-line\">              int offset,</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3</span><span class=\"source-line\">              void **mem,</span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 514 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"514\">核对原页</button></p></div>"},{"n":515,"html":"<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"4\" data-end=\"47\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单 · 跨页续接</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4</span><span class=\"source-line\">              struct device_node *dad,</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5</span><span class=\"source-line\">              struct device_node **pnp,</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6</span><span class=\"source-line\">              bool dryrun)</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7</span><span class=\"source-line\">    {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8</span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct device_node *np;  // 设备节点指针</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">9</span><span class=\"source-line\">    const char *pathp;  // 节点路径字符串指针</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">10</span><span class=\"source-line\">    unsigned int l, allocl;  // 路径字符串长度和分配的内存大小</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">11</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">12</span><span class=\"source-line\">    pathp = fdt_get_name(blob, offset, &amp;l);  // 获取节点路径和长度</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">13</span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (!pathp) {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">14</span><span class=\"source-line\">        *pnp = NULL;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">15</span><span class=\"source-line\">        return false;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">16</span><span class=\"source-line\">    }</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">17</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">18</span><span class=\"source-line\">    allocl = ++l;  // 分配内存大小为路径长度加一，用于存储节点路径字符串</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">19</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">20</span><span class=\"source-line\">    np = unflatten_dt_alloc(mem, sizeof(struct device_node) + allocl,</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">21</span><span class=\"source-line\">                __alignof__(struct device_node));  // 分配设备节点内存</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">22</span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (!dryrun) {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">23</span><span class=\"source-line\">        char *fn;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">24</span><span class=\"source-line\">        of_node_init(np);  // 初始化设备节点</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">25</span><span class=\"source-line\">        np-&gt;full_name = fn = ((char *)np) + sizeof(*np);  // 设置设备节点的完整路径名</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">26</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">27</span><span class=\"source-line\">        memcpy(fn, pathp, l);  // 将节点路径字符串复制到设备节点的完整路径名中</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">28</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">29</span><span class=\"source-line\">        if (dad != NULL) {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">30</span><span class=\"source-line\">            np-&gt;parent = dad;  // 设置设备节点的父节点</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">31</span><span class=\"source-line\">            np-&gt;sibling = dad-&gt;child;  // 设置设备节点的兄弟节点</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">32</span><span class=\"source-line\">            dad-&gt;child = np;  // 将设备节点添加为父节点的子节点</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">33</span><span class=\"source-line\">        }</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">34</span><span class=\"source-line\">    }</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">35</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">36</span><span class=\"source-line\">    populate_properties(blob, offset, mem, np, pathp, dryrun);  // 填充设备节点的属性信息</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">37</span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (!dryrun) {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">38</span><span class=\"source-line\">        np-&gt;name = of_get_property(np, &quot;name&quot;, NULL);  // 获取设备节点的名称属性</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">39</span><span class=\"source-line\">        np-&gt;type = of_get_property(np, &quot;device_type&quot;, NULL);  // 获取设备节点的设备类型属性</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">40</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">41</span><span class=\"source-line\">        if (!np-&gt;name)</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">42</span><span class=\"source-line\">            np-&gt;name = &quot;&lt;NULL&gt;&quot;;  // 如果设备节点没有名称属性，则设置为&quot;&lt;NULL&gt;&quot;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">43</span><span class=\"source-line\">        if (!np-&gt;type)</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">44</span><span class=\"source-line\">            np-&gt;type = &quot;&lt;NULL&gt;&quot;;  // 如果设备节点没有设备类型属性，则设置为&quot;&lt;NULL&gt;&quot;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">45</span><span class=\"source-line\">    }</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">46</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">47</span><span class=\"source-line\">    *pnp = np;  // 将设备节点指针赋值给*pnp</span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 515 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"515\">核对原页</button></p></div>"},{"n":516,"html":"<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"48\" data-end=\"49\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单 · 跨页续接</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">48</span><span class=\"source-line\">    return true;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">49</span><span class=\"source-line\">}</span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 516 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"516\">核对原页</button></p></div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">在populate_node ()函数中首先会调用unflatten_dt_alloc ()函数分配设备节点内存。分配的内存大小为sizeof(struct device_node) + allocl 字节，并使用__alignof__(struct device_node) 对齐。然后调用populate_properties ()函数填充设备节点的属性信息。</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">至此，关于dtb 二进制文件展开成device_node 的过程就讲解完成了，完整的源码分析流程图如图70.3 所示。</p>\n<figure class=\"book-figure\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"zoom-image\" aria-label=\"放大图70.3\"><img src=\"3568阅读资源/figures/p0516-fig01.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"图70.3\" width=\"974\" height=\"293\"></button><figcaption>图70.3 · 点击放大</figcaption></figure>"},{"n":517,"html":"<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b507\"></span><h2 class=\"book-heading\">第71 章device_node 转换成platform_device</h2>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">dtb 展开成device_node 这时候还并不能跟内核中的platform_driver 进行对接，为了让操作系统能够识别和管理设备，需要将设备节点转换为platform_device。</p>\n<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b508\"></span><h3 class=\"book-heading\">71.1 转换规则</h3>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">在平台总线模型中，device 部分是用platform_device 结构体来描述硬件资源的，所以内核最终会将内核认识的device_node 树转换为platform_ device，但是并不是所有的device_node都会被转换成platform_ device，只有满足要求的才会转换成platform_ device。转换成platform_device 的节点可以在/sys/bus/platform/devices 下查看，那device_node 节点要满足什么要求才会被转换成platform_device 呢？</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">规则1：根节点下有compatible 属性的子节点。</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">规则2：节点中compatible 属性值是simple-bus、simple-mfd 和isa 其中之一，并且该节点下的子节点有compatible 属性。该节点下的子节点会被转换成platform_device。规则3：节点中compatible属性有arm或primecell，则对应的节点不会被转换成platform_device。</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">接下来将通过几个设备树示例对上述规则进行实践。举例1 如代码清单71.1 所示。</p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单71.1</p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"15\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1</span><span class=\"source-line\">/dts-v1/;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3</span><span class=\"source-line\">/ {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4</span><span class=\"source-line\">    model = &quot;This is my devicetree!&quot;;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5</span><span class=\"source-line\">    #address-cells = &lt;1&gt;;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6</span><span class=\"source-line\">    #size-cells = &lt;1&gt;;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8</span><span class=\"source-line\">    chosen {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">9</span><span class=\"source-line\">        bootargs = &quot;root=/dev/nfs rw nfsroot=192.168.1.1 console=ttyS0, 115200&quot;;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">10</span><span class=\"source-line\">    };</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">11</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">12</span><span class=\"source-line\">    cpu1: cpu@1 {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">13</span><span class=\"source-line\">        device_type = &quot;cpu&quot;;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">14</span><span class=\"source-line\">        compatible = &quot;arm,cortex-a35&quot;, &quot;arm,armv8&quot;;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">15</span><span class=\"source-line\">        reg = &lt;0x0 0x1&gt;;</span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 517 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"517\">核对原页</button></p></div>"}]});
